{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-026-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_7544-2-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0111-012-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-033-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-042-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>小巷裏的粉麵店、還有租書店，多年來為街坊飽肚，和提供精神食糧。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0912-024-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0912-073-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1005-078-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0912-090-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>仁愛圍路口的小販區，當年小販多只在上午開檔。背後的雞記蔴雀娛樂，是裕民坊的地標，現已隨重建而搬舖。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-020-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>銀都戲院，曾䇄立半情紀，在 2009 年結業，現址已建成豪宅。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0224-003-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1005-075-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0529-007-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0228-010-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1005-044-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0228-001-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0627-DVS_9202-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T04:40:32.614836+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":18,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}